  "verses": [
    {
      "verse": 1,
      "sanskrit": "भीष्म उवाच।\n              ततः स लुब्धकः पश्यन् क्षुधयापि परिप्लुतः । कपोतमग्निपतितं वाक्यं पुनरुवाच ह ॥१॥",
      "english": "Yudhishthira said. Without giving up the domestic mode of life, O royal sage of Kuru's race, who ever acquired Liberation which is the annihilation of the Understanding? Do tell me this.",
